  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed at the queue head#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: Old pane received an input during the restart
  s4: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s5: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s6: Exclusion released#59; seed waits for the owner
  s7: Owner turn installed Pending and creates
  s8: One new Ready session#59; inputs await the owner
  s9: One new Ready session#59; inputs settled once
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s3: Stale permission types into the old pane
  s2 --> s4: Close only the captured pane
  s4 --> s5: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s5 --> s6: Disconnect keeping selector, release, wake
  s6 --> s7: Owner starts the seed: install Pending
  s7 --> s8: Submit the first input and bind the source
  s8 --> s9: Submit an input to the successor once
